{"title":"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All three vertices of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3df79a4384bc29acd37e14b0430773d09964ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup ABC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> lie on the parabola defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef862bdd16c2d5356e11735b8c766c402f5e10c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> at the origin and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> parallel to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis. The area of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. What is the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />?  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/7337279a6bbe10f38f6c6f9b4ef1af28e4441761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plotting points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on the graph shows that they have coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6db92abed2798e5ffe6b0e3e07dc4ef78b82ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( -x,x^2\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"64\" height=\"22\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e21817a2e0b1634dda5fe3b90d0841bb92dfa880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( x,x^2\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"22\" />. Note that the order does not matter. By setting up the area formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1c4803fc443252d95f5c19b79d2af0074264d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} bh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"31\" height=\"37\" /> with base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/3/db33a467b2c86363c2f40968ce9fea83e4dfd059.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> and height from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef58e74d6ffc14072ae5ee90916046109f1c9b2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[64=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2x\\cdot x^2 =x^3 \\implies x = 4\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"37\" />\nThe length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72018c4224b234db20bdd33a4343170ee495ae69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>By: Albert471\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B\">2016 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2016 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" type